{
  "$comment": [
    "FSPIOP JWS conformance vectors \u2014 shared by the TypeScript monorepo and the Java connectors.",
    "Language-neutral on purpose: both implementations execute this file, so drift between them",
    "shows up as a failing test rather than as a rejected signature at a peer months later.",
    "",
    "'expected.protectedHeader' and 'expected.fspiopUri' are the contract, hand-written from the",
    "reference implementation quoted in trust-manager-docs/design/hub-facing-leg.md section A2.",
    "The remaining 'expected' fields are mechanical encodings of those two, not independent claims.",
    "",
    "Signatures are deliberately absent: RS256 over a fixed input is deterministic, but pinning one",
    "would pin a key too. Implementations sign these inputs with their own key and verify round-trip."
  ],
  "algorithm": "RS256",
  "vectors": [
    {
      "name": "put-quotes-with-destination",
      "note": "The common case. Note content-type is NOT in the protected header.",
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "url": "https://hub.example.com/quotes/abc-123",
        "headers": {
          "content-type": "application/vnd.interoperability.quotes+json;version=2.0",
          "date": "Tue, 23 Aug 2026 09:15:00 GMT",
          "fspiop-source": "payeefsp",
          "fspiop-destination": "payerfsp"
        },
        "body": {
          "transferAmount": {
            "currency": "MMK",
            "amount": "1000"
          },
          "expiration": "2026-08-23T09:30:00.000Z"
        }
      },
      "expected": {
        "fspiopUri": "/quotes/abc-123",
        "protectedHeader": {
          "alg": "RS256",
          "FSPIOP-URI": "/quotes/abc-123",
          "FSPIOP-HTTP-Method": "PUT",
          "FSPIOP-Source": "payeefsp",
          "FSPIOP-Destination": "payerfsp",
          "Date": "Tue, 23 Aug 2026 09:15:00 GMT"
